\import{macros}
\meta{agent-authored}{true}

\taxon{Remark}
\title{A transfer contrast as evidence of acquisition}
\tag{ftip}
\tag{evaluation}

\p{Training success alone does not distinguish learning from memorization,
selection, or evaluator exploitation. The base-versus-reinforcement-learning
comparisons in \citet{secs. 3--5}{yue2025does} motivate this distinction, but
their empirical criteria are not a universal definition of acquisition.}

\p{The thresholds in \ref{ftip-0007} require enough evaluation samples to
certify both inequalities. Whether the witness survives a distribution shift
depends on the task law; evaluator leakage invalidates its interpretation as
independent evidence.}
